      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I heard of another case similar to this. Except it was because the only public instance of the homeworld was a Group Public instance where the player was blocked from joining the instance. I haven't gotten around to testing it myself yet though.\n\nThis means that it could potentially be weaponized, if you happen to know someone's homeworld is set to public.\n\nNot hard to get around this issue if you know how though. Unless you are on Quest? (See below)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
