      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6015a8dedd548068697b6112|full_name}: If you encounter this issue and you are on PC, you can simply launch the client with a `vrchat://launch?ref=vrchat.com&id=wrld_4432ea9b-729c-46e3-8eaf-846aa0a37fdd` link so you load into a different world on startup.\n\nNot sure this would be possible from a Quest though.",
